<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $1.00/1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $1.00/1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday, slaughter steers, heifers and Holstien steers sold $1.00 to 1.50 higher with good demand for all classes.  - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1125-1425 lbs 63.75-66.00.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1450 lbs 62.00-64.00. Select 2-3 1025-1300 lbs 58.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 975-1325 lbs 62.50-64.80.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-4 1000-1350 lbs 60.50-63.00. Select 2-3 1025-1275 lbs 57.00-60.50.</p>
</text>
